    (by simpa using e 0 0 v) (by simpa using e 0 1 v) (by simpa using e 1 1 v)
  refine ⟨s, θ, ?_⟩
  ext i j v
  fin_cases i <;> fin_cases j <;> simp [rot, eps, h1, h2, h3, h4]

